<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-19T22:20:49.950Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 22:20:49 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Bandits continue to target civilians and mining operations in Plateau, killing three at a mining site and later killing nine in a separate attack, while also kidnapping six people and stealing livestock in Sokoto. Nigerian security forces are confronting bandits in Kwara and have seized uniforms and military caps from them in northern forests, and they rescued 125 kidnapping victims and dismantled terrorist camps, killing 21 ISWAP fighters in Borno. Police are searching for the family of a Canadian-Nigerian man killed in a road crash near Lagos Airport. The conflict recorded 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxQS1dKb3ZqNzh4VjlGRWk3UWRvY0NXd3FIdHdETFBDUjdIVFFKWlMtdS1mcklPMzk2eWo4STBGekIzd0FDYXFQeE5LSEpNUTFFRDRfNUFYMDNGV2tYQ0MxRGotOUR2NVVpNDlsT0c2WUhiYzliekstYTdJNXY2Rm96ak1EQThDTV9neXZYcGQtWXgxZ1dhZmh1bnl4aVZfVU1CR2pPNUU3U3lLUGhYTXU3ZG9yZGI?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiU0FVX3lxTE9OX3lRcHhwTWRYZmsyeVBxazJUMl9QLUpjcmd5bnU3ZmEtMXI1M3M5WDN6dkxDZVRNLTUtbDVqLUgybUdBb0NYSTVwd2REb2VRNnFn?oc=5&quot;&gt;شبكة تواصل الإخبارية&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxPTHB6dnV2Q1NrZE5lVEgtMVhWS2RkekZzNExVLWFHYVBMWEpxYnkxWXIxcTR2YV9LRkQ2Z295SGRaNldQblhVZGF5ekxNSTlweFo3WEtyT2VOZm5VUVBTY1B2bEtDVkRfQnVZVmFud3ZMZUFmbVN2elMxUGJBaVlXNjluMUg?oc=5&quot;&gt;LEADERSHIP Newspapers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxPQmNwMFplRGRzTXlqTWlUMjI0MmQwa2wtUHFlaS1YUnZZUDZVSjdMbWpMLWpWUmo2VVRCOGdDZ2tQSWNkWlJjcUFndFdmS21YaHZiVUV3OV8yN2Z6b3VJSl9FUUtHYzFQZnZROElpSWdLVGdyRVRVdXlkRjVJOXR5S0ZMRHNTY3VON2w3TDU3TWNvZEM3ek5RRDJRd1k2Zw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Head Topics&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.goog